<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-KENYA 215-8 IN 50 OVERS V IRELAND IN ICC SEMIFINAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KENYA 215-8 IN 50 OVERS V IRELAND IN ICC SEMIFINAL.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya scored 215 for eight off their 50 overs in the rain-affected International Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy semifinal against Ireland on Sunday.</p>
<p>The match will resume on Monday.</p>
</text>
